# Local-only state for the chicken-and-egg bootstrap. Back this up
# out-of-band (e.g. encrypted to the laptop's backup) — losing it
# means manually importing the state bucket on the next apply, but it
# contains no secrets the OVH manager can't otherwise re-issue.
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately *not* ignored — pinning the OVH
# provider version is exactly the kind of reproducibility this dir needs
# (the main config alongside ops/.terraform.lock.hcl follows the same
# rule).
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
.terraform/
